** Design Hierarchy: ** The processor is organized in a modular hierarchy where mips_single_cycle.v serves as the top-level integration module, combining the controlpath and top_datapath modules. The datapath is further decomposed into reusable functional blocks such as the Program Counter, Instruction Memory, Register File, Sign Extension Unit, ALU, and Data Memory.

mips_single_cycle.v
    controlpath.v
    top_datapath.v
          alu_datablock.v
          data_mem_datablock.v
          inst_mem_datablock.v
          pc_datablock.v
          reg_file_datablock.v
          sign_extend_datablock.v
